        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The existence of a supermajority requirement constitutes a legitimate barrier to action, not just a technicality.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members value accuracy in political explanations over simplified narratives.",
        "confidence": 0.86
