    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84197.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "And again, to hit on the area of agricultural work visas, since that's a big concern in your district, I hear from what you're saying that there are people who are coming here to work on visas in the agricultural sector and perhaps others. And instead of there being just a one worker to one employer relationship, they get in. skip that job and they take other jobs and other positions that are not part of the original visa and basically things get out of hand is what you're saying.",
